  "definition": "Registration of Radiation or MRI Machines",
  "effectiveDate": "2015-06-25",
  "historyNote": "#6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #7919, eff 7-18-03; amd by #9945-A, eff 6-22-11, (paras (a), (c), & (d)-(j)); amd by #9945-B, eff 6-22-11, (para (b)); ss by #10864, eff 6-25-15",
